    "title": "Nashville's Caitlin Nichol-Thomas returns for annual Cook County shows - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Will Moore ,\n1 days ago Caitlin-Nichol Thomas is an accomplished fiddler, guitarist, and songwriter based out of Nashville with strong ties to the North Shore and the music scene of Cook County. Every year, she returns to the area to get back to the great outdoors and play with local musicians at the county’s many venues. She joins Will Moore on the Scenic Route to talk about what she’s been up to and performs some new songs. Read full article",
